# Writes the reference of docs/api.md from the comments of src/, run from the mod's folder:
#   haxe tools/apidoc.hxml          writes it
#   haxe tools/apidoc.hxml check    only tells whether it is up to date
# Its parser is not released for Haxe 4.3, so it comes from its repository:
#   haxelib git haxeparser https://github.com/HaxeCheckstyle/haxeparser 49db59c303242c7e6ef1293e35ac5983f31f654d
-cp tools
-lib haxeparser
--run ApiDoc
